{
    "title": "Coloring Paint: ASMR Superhero",
    "description": "Do you want to relax, learn draw and coloring ?\r\nCreate your own masterpiece or get inspiration and browse through thousands of beautiful coloring pages in our gallery created by our awesome Coloring Paint: ASMR Superhero !\r\nComplete hundreds of super heroes pictures, improve your art skills and soothe your mind with this bright, creative and relaxing game for players of all ages.\r\n\r\n<b>Coloring Paint: ASMR Superhero</b> Features\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Hundred pictures for painting include super hero, animals, nature , and more.\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Line and color: first draw the following line of the object, then color the space to complete the picture. And remember to pick colors to match the order, the more matches the color, the higher accuracy you will get! \r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Improve your art skill\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Relieve your stress and unleash your creativity\r\n\r\nRelax and enjoy all the fun of coloring and drawing without any mess or expensive materials, right on your device, Coloring Paint: ASMR Superhero is your first choice. \r\nDownload this delightful virtual coloring book on your device right now and have a good time relaxing and creating your artwork.\r\n\r\nWe update the game regularly with your suggestions, so leave us a review and we\u2019ll do our best to improve the game.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you want to relax, learn draw and coloring ?<br>Create your own masterpiece or get inspiration and browse through thousands of beautiful coloring pages in our gallery created by our awesome Coloring Paint: ASMR Superhero !<br>Complete hundreds of super heroes pictures, improve your art skills and soothe your mind with this bright, creative and relaxing game for players of all ages.<br><br><b>Coloring Paint: ASMR Superhero</b> Features<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Hundred pictures for painting include super hero, animals, nature , and more.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Line and color: first draw the following line of the object, then color the space to complete the picture. And remember to pick colors to match the order, the more matches the color, the higher accuracy you will get! <br>\ud83c\udfa8 Improve your art skill<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Relieve your stress and unleash your creativity<br><br>Relax and enjoy all the fun of coloring and drawing without any mess or expensive materials, right on your device, Coloring Paint: ASMR Superhero is your first choice. <br>Download this delightful virtual coloring book on your device right now and have a good time relaxing and creating your artwork.<br><br>We update the game regularly with your suggestions, so leave us a review and we\u2019ll do our best to improve the game.",
